# **MUVANTA 2.0 — Complete Master Feature List**

**MUVANTA is a global entertainment discovery, tracking, rating, recommendation, analytics and social platform for movies, television series, anime and documentaries.**

This is the consolidated feature catalogue for our project. It combines our existing ZIP functionality, previously discussed requirements, and the five-phase product vision.

I have separated core features from advanced and future features so that we don't confuse planned functionality with features that have already been built.

