**One important distinction:** This is our consolidated target feature specification, not a claim that all these features are already implemented or formally locked. Some are established project requirements; others are proposed extensions that must be approved and specified before development.

My recommendation is to treat this as the master feature inventory and give every feature a unique ID, priority, dependencies, database requirements, acceptance criteria and implementation phase. That will prevent AI Studio or Gemini from forgetting features, inventing completed functionality or rebuilding the same component unnecessarily.

The ultimate goal is to make MUVANTA a complete entertainment management platform rather than simply another movie-rating website.